    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `model_client.py` file, I need to include the necessary imports and functions to interact with a hosted LLM service. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service as the concrete third-party managed service for this task. The code will include the import of the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with the Bedrock service. I will also include a function to select a model family and another function to perform inference using the selected model. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789848573231,
          "start": 1789848570005
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb49c8950010PrPWdobZsNO73",
