    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that streams partial output tokens from a hosted LLM, I need to select a concrete external provider. I'll choose Amazon Bedrock for this task, as it is a well-known service that provides access to various LLMs. I will use the Amazon Bedrock SDK to interact with the service and make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789848566778,
          "start": 1789848564175
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb49b1cf001jW0Whl1jwLjYqY",
